Field Type Default Description <code>skipCheck</code> <code>bool</code> <code>false</code> When <code>true</code>, the updater ignores whatever exit code the setup returns and always considers the installation successful. <code>successCodes</code> <code>int[]</code> <code>[0]</code> List of exit codes accepted as success. Any code in this list causes the updater to treat the installation as having succeeded. <p>Accept both plain success (0) and MSI reboot-required (3010)</p> <pre><code>{
    "releases": [{
        "exitCode": {
            "successCodes": [0, 3010]
        }
    }]
}
</code></pre>
